sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 用户 (UI/Sticky)
  participant M as workflow 引擎 (manager)
  participant S as StateStore (DynamoDB)
  participant W as Worker (machine 或 cloud)
  participant X as 外部系统 (GitHub/PR)
  participant WA as Watcher

  U->>M: 提交任务 (workspace id)
  M->>S: createRoot(workspace) [条件写,提交幂等]
  S-->>M: state=A, progress=new
  M->>S: 抢 lease (CAS: new->in-progress)
  S-->>M: 认领成功 (恰好一个 runner)
  M->>W: enter(input, A, substate)
  Note over W: 若 worker=affinity:cloud, 此刻用户即可关机断网
  W->>X: tool 调用 (创建 PR)
  W->>S: checkpoint(substate) [续 lease]
  W-->>M: output, route=spawn/toState
  M->>S: transition 原子写下一步 (waiting: 等 PR merge)
  Note over M,S: 用户此时可关机/断网,云端任务已持久化

  WA->>X: 轮询/webhook PR 状态 (edge-triggered)
  X-->>WA: PR merged (状态跃迁,仅触发一次)
  WA->>S: signal(workspace, envelope) [dedup-key 条件写] waiting->new
  M->>S: 扫到 new,抢 lease
  M->>W: enter(下一步)
  W-->>M: finish(output)
  M->>S: finishBranch, progress=finished
  M->>U: 回叫通知 (该你做动作了: 审查/签收)
